<http://data.silknow.org/object/05aab8cf-0a3e-34e7-8ccf-a82a930f54e9>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric, silk and cotton plain weave brocaded with silk and metal thread.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: pink silk\nWeft: pink [?] cotton\nBrocading Weft: silk: black, light green, dark green, blue, mauve, pink; metal thread: silver strip S-wound on white silk core.\nThe lower sides have been cut into a concave curve.\nPink ground with offset rows of an oval shaped floral arrangement: small light coloured bowl at the base, pair of green leaves, a blue and a light green blossom, a small central pink and mauve mauve [?] flower, to the left is a silver [?] pointed flower and to the right is a left-curving stem with small flowers."@en , "brocaded, 1800s, Persian; Flowers"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/600f232d-a969-3c8d-9292-7bb89410ba78> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/fcaba6e6-87f5-3c97-a8f7-7686dde2e4c2> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/27e925bd-ab0f-3a30-916b-5615424a3c24> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/3c46f8eb-88a3-338a-bebf-d0868a4a486c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric, silk and cotton plain weave brocaded with silk and metal thread.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: pink silk\nWeft: pink [?] cotton\nBrocading Weft: silk: black, light green, dark green, blue, mauve, pink; metal thread: silver strip S-wound on white silk core.\nThe lower sides have been cut into a concave curve.\nPink ground with offset rows of an oval shaped floral arrangement: small light coloured bowl at the base, pair of green leaves, a blue and a light green blossom, a small central pink and mauve mauve [?] flower, to the left is a silver [?] pointed flower and to the right is a left-curving stem with small flowers."@en , "brocaded, 1800s, Persian; Flowers"@en ;
